5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about long-term stability. Which proposals rely on external partners?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We should verify if past similar projects actually improved patient outcomes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Staffing capacity is the silent killer. Who is absorbing the new workload?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am curious about the hidden costs. Who is tracking the recurring expenses?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I just want to know if our current rooms and parking can handle more people.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Misaki, that is a valid point. I have seen good ideas fail due to burnout.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We need data, not just enthusiasm. Let us look at the records.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will check the staffing reviews. I need to see the actual vacancy rates.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will look at the ledger. I want to see what is actually left after overhead.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will check the booking system. I need to see how full we already are.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look into the readmission figures. I want to see if the trial worked.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the board minutes. I want to see what was decided before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the therapy staffing. I need to see the midwifery numbers too.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the regional fund tariffs. I want to see the income side.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the rooms and parking coverage. I need to see the physical limits.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,Thank you all. Let us see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. The truth is often quieter than the pitch.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will be reviewing the rosters. I hope they are honest.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will be calculating the break-even point. I hope it is not negative.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will be counting the spaces. I hope there is enough room for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
