35,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The readmission data is promising, but the staffing gap is worrying. We are relying on agency cover.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The board minutes show a joint clinic failed because no one owned the budget. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The therapy review shows four years of physiotherapists leaving. The midwifery rota has slack, but nursing is empty.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The ledger shows the development fund is down by a quarter. Fitting out is now charged against it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The booking system has no slot for walk-ins. The car park is full by eleven. We are already at capacity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that is a serious constraint. We cannot fund a program that needs new rooms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, the readmission trial worked, but it stopped. We need a sustainable model, not a trial.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,The nursing vacancies mean any new program will just add to the agency bill. That is not sustainable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,The tariffs show that off-site contacts earn nothing. On-site sessions bill at the standard rate.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we add a program, where do the patients go? The shuttle only goes to four villages.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think we need a program that uses existing staff and rooms. No new infrastructure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The call-back trial is a good model. It used existing nurses and phones.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The call-back trial used nurses who were already there. It did not add to the agency bill.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,The call-back trial earned back its cost in six months. The other proposals do not.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The call-back trial does not need new rooms. It does not need new parking. It fits.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am leaning towards the call-back trial. It is sustainable and it works.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I support the call-back trial. It is quiet, effective, and it does not add to the pile.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I will support the call-back trial. It does not add to the nursing vacancies.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I will support the call-back trial. It is the only one that pays for itself.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I will support the call-back trial. It fits into the day we already have.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
