60,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option A, the Home Follow-Up Team, seems to match the call-back trial's success. It uses existing nurses.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option A is the quiet choice. It does not add to the infrastructure. It just adds a visit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A uses nurses who are already on the ward. It does not add to the agency bill.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A is the only one that fits the ledger. It does not need new rooms or new tariffs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A does not need new rooms. It does not need new parking. It fits into the day.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Midori,,I am concerned about Option B. It needs a dedicated space. We do not have one.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,Option B is too loud. It needs new equipment and new staff. It adds to the pile.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Misaki,,Option B adds to the therapy staffing gap. We are already losing physiotherapists.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,Option B does not earn back its cost. The tariffs do not cover the fitting out.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Option B needs a room. We do not have a room. The car park is full.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Midori,,"Option C is good, but it needs coordinators. We do not have coordinators.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C is a good idea, but it is a new role. It adds to the complexity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Option C adds to the nursing vacancies. It needs people who are not there.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,Option C does not earn back its cost. The tariffs do not cover the coordination time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,Option C needs a desk. We do not have a desk. The booking system has no slot.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Midori,,"Option D is kind, but it needs midwifery staff. We have slack, but not enough.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Option D is a good idea, but it is a new service. It adds to the pile.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"Option D uses the midwifery slack, but it adds to the pediatric load. It is not balanced.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,Option D does not earn back its cost. The tariffs do not cover the joint sessions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Option D needs a room. We do not have a room. The shuttle does not go to all villages.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
